  "description": "A bird is the sacred symbol of the great empire Apollinaire. In fact, legend has it that one day a sacred bird of silver and gold will come to earth and bring glory to the empire. Nowadays, the thing on everyone’s mind is when the emperor will find a wife. Since Richard Apollinaire is a romantic, he wants to fall in love instead of marrying for politics. Then one day, a small egg appears and from it hatches... a tiny silver and gold bird.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
